
## `.gitignore` for `twinspec-lakehouse`

Use this at the repo root:

```gitignore
# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.pyd
*.pkl
*.egg-info/
.env
.venv
venv/
env/
pip-wheel-metadata/

# Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# VS Code
.vscode/
.history/

# Logs and temp
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*.swo

# Data that should not be versioned (optional; comment out if you want all raw data in git)
# If some files become huge, consider adding patterns here or using Git LFS instead.

# Unity metadata output (you might choose to track or ignore these)
# If you want Unity metadata regenerated from CSVs, ignore them:
# unity_metadata/*.json

# Misc
*.DS_Store
